{
  "schema": "h3.test.clip_audio_admission_rows.v1",
  "description": "One table for both snapshot decoders: which clip of the accepted composition (`m25_10_composition_contract_v1.json`) may carry an audio member that is not the identity. `clip_id` names the clip that is given `audio`; `asset_id`, when present, first makes that clip use another asset; `embedded_audio`, when present, first declares that clip's asset with that audio. `result` is `accepted` or the refusal code.",
